{"path":"language/namespace_alias","title":"Namespace aliases","titleHtml":"Namespace aliases","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/namespace_alias","section":"language","kind":"page","summary":"Namespace aliases allow the programmer to define an alternate name for a namespace.","html":"<p>Namespace aliases allow the programmer to define an alternate name for a namespace.  \n</p><p>They are commonly used as a convenient shortcut for long or deeply-nested namespaces.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Syntax\">Syntax</h3>\n<table class=\"t-sdsc-begin\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-sdsc\">\n<td> <code><b>namespace</b></code> <span class=\"t-spar\">alias_name</span> = <span class=\"t-spar\">ns_name</span><code><b>;</b></code>\n</td>\n<td> (1)\n</td>\n<td class=\"t-sdsc-nopad\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-sdsc\">\n<td> <code><b>namespace</b></code> <span class=\"t-spar\">alias_name</span> = <code><b>::</b></code><span class=\"t-spar\">ns_name</span><code><b>;</b></code>\n</td>\n<td> (2)\n</td>\n<td class=\"t-sdsc-nopad\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-sdsc\">\n<td> <code><b>namespace</b></code> <span class=\"t-spar\">alias_name</span> = <span class=\"t-spar\">nested_name</span><code><b>::</b></code><span class=\"t-spar\">ns_name</span><code><b>;</b></code>\n</td>\n<td> (3)\n</td>\n<td class=\"t-sdsc-nopad\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\" class=\"t-sdsc-sep\">\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Explanation\">Explanation</h3>\n<p>The new alias <span class=\"t-spar\">alias_name</span> provides an alternate method of accessing <span class=\"t-spar\">ns_name</span>.  \n</p><p><span class=\"t-spar\">alias_name</span> must be a name not previously used.  <span class=\"t-spar\">alias_name</span> is valid for the duration of the scope in which it is introduced.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Keywords\">Keywords</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/namespace\"><code>namespace</code></a>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> foo\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> bar\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n         <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> baz\n         <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n             <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> qux <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">42</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n         <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> fbz <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> foo<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">bar</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">baz</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> fbz<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">qux</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>42</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/namespace\"> namespace declaration </a>\n</td>\n<td>  identifies a namespace</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/type_alias\"> type alias declaration </a><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span>\n</td>\n<td>  creates a synonym for a type</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Syntax","id":"Syntax"},{"depth":3,"text":"Explanation","id":"Explanation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Keywords","id":"Keywords"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"language","title":"C++ language"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"Namespace aliases","children":[{"label":"Syntax"},{"label":"Explanation","note":"The new alias alias_name provides an alternate method of accessing ns_name."},{"label":"Keywords","note":"namespace"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"namespace declaration","note":"identifies a namespace"},{"label":"type alias declaration (C++11)","note":"creates a synonym for a type"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":129,"codeBlockCount":2}
